      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n  // RFCOMM sockets must be torn down before tearing down the underlying\n  // L2CAP sockets. \n  bt_status_t status \u003d btsock_rfc_disconnect(bd_addr);\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 412,
